%% UC-32 — Delete account (App Store 5.1.1(v) / GDPR right to erasure)
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor P as Participant
    participant F as Flutter App (Settings)
    participant B as Backend (usersRouter)
    participant M as MongoDB
    participant KC as Keycloak (Admin API)

    P->>F: Settings -> "Delete account"
    F-->>P: Confirmation dialog (lists exactly what is deleted)
    P->>F: Confirm "Delete permanently"
    F->>B: DELETE /api/v1/users/me (Bearer token)
    loop participant-linked collections
        B->>M: deleteMany({userId}) — users, profiles, enrollments, intentions,<br/>daily logs, SRHI, form responses, recommendations, feedback,<br/>device tokens, consents
    end
    B->>KC: DELETE /admin/realms/hhh/users/{sub} (idempotent)
    KC-->>B: 204 (or 404 = already gone)
    B-->>F: 200 {ok, deleted counts}
    Note over B: Donated habits in Neo4j carry no user identifier (anonymous by design)
    F->>F: Wipe secure storage, logout
    F-->>P: Back to onboarding welcome screen
